            <div xml:id="d525">

                <pb facs="0699" n="605" sameAs="frus:frus1924v02/pg605"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">871.63/18: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Rumania</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Jay</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bucharest</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-05-30T11:00:00+01:44"><hi rendition="#italic">May 30, 1924—11
                                a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 9:50 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>19. Mining bill is before Parliament now. I have received copies of new draft
                    from Minister of Foreign Affairs, but oil interests find <pb facs="0700" n="606"
                        xml:id="pg606"/> it just as unsatisfactory as previous draft. The Legation
                    likewise considers the bill still very unsatisfactory, the changes appearing to
                    be unimportant.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Jay</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
